Friday is here and today we finish the last of our holiday Drum Sing Dance Incursions with [The Springfield Anglican College](https://tsac.qld.edu.au/). It has been an interesting couple of weeks with lock-downs, masks and the rain. We are sure you are all feeling it too!

Depsite all of the chaos and cancellations over the past two weeks we have still managed to bring the joy of Drum Sing Dance to [Jimboomba OSHC](https://jimboombass.eq.edu.au/facilities/out-of-school-hours-care), [Autism Camp Australia](https://www.autismcampaustralia.org/) on the Sunshine Coast, [Wilston Kids Care](https://www.wilstonpandc.org.au/wilston-kids-care) in Grange, [PCYC in Burnside](https://www.pcyc.org.au/oshc/burnside-outside-school-hours-care/), [St Mary's OSHC](https://www.catholicearlyedcare.qld.edu.au/st-marys-outside-school-hours-care-woodend/) in Bundaberg. [YMCA in Palmview](https://www.ymcachildcare.com.au/outside-school-hours-care/palmview), [Autism QLD](https://autismqld.com.au/) in Sunnybank and [St Paul's OSHC](https://www.ymcachildcare.com.au/outside-school-hours-care/st-paul-s) in Caboolture.

All of the children and carers have been super enthusiastic and excited about our visit. It has been lovely to see some familiar faces again and it's always so rewarding when you drive lots of K's to then be greeted by a bunch of excited children adults!

We don't really get a holiday but we do love sharing our Holiday Drum Sing Dance incursions with children all over South East QLD. Can you take a holiday after a holiday?... mmm probably not, as next week we are back with [adults classes](/classes/) and [school incursions](/school-incursions/). No rest but a whole lot of action!

We look forward to some super sunny sunshine, no masks and some freedom!! Yay! This too shall pass! ;)
